69},{"id":1782640656948,"text":"但是那个皇帝愿意为了主控，打破这个规矩","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640874889,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55770},{"id":1782640656949,"text":"然后很多大臣都在那里说这个皇帝","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640881117,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55771},{"id":1782640656950,"text":"但是他说主控更重要","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640886554,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55772},{"id":1782640656951,"text":"他要让天下人都知道他很爱主控","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640894616,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55773},{"id":1782640656952,"text":"两个人就是有点像那个苏妲己和纣王","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640905369,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55774},{"id":1782640656953,"text":"但是这个皇帝最开始是明君","sender":"me","time":"18:01","timestamp":1782640913041,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55775},{"id":1782640656954,"text":"后来是因为主控，然后慢慢变得有点偏执，然后开始昏庸","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640921137,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55776},{"id":1782640656955,"text":"最后开始只在意主控，不在意他的国家","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640926925,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55777},{"id":1782640656956,"text":"然后最后两个人一起被叛军烧死","sender":"me","time":"18:02","timestamp":1782640935687,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":55778},{"id":1782